<item>
            <title>[PLM-1005] Automatic Linking via API Meditap version 2.0</title>
                <link>https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/browse/PLM-1005</link>
                <project id="10125" key="PLM">Platform</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Docs:&lt;/b&gt; [^&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;API Documentation&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Meditap Provider (1) (2).pdf] &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Testing Card Sample:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1km0y01ldcQdCOZbfj2yYjrrkBAQ6neFqvBfTUUeWkb4/edit?gid=461304010#gid=461304010&quot; title=&quot;smart-link&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1km0y01ldcQdCOZbfj2yYjrrkBAQ6neFqvBfTUUeWkb4/edit?gid=461304010#gid=461304010&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figma:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/design/WfW4YFo1KaV4AXE9y7QioD/%5BPIE%5D-Push-Notification-%26-Error-Messages-(updated)-%5BUAPP%5D?node-id=1-74&amp;amp;p=f&amp;amp;t=uCXwK1uNRF5u1FtC-0&quot; title=&quot;smart-link&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;https://www.figma.com/design/WfW4YFo1KaV4AXE9y7QioD/%5BPIE%5D-Push-Notification-%26-Error-Messages-(updated)-%5BUAPP%5D?node-id=1-74&amp;amp;p=f&amp;amp;t=uCXwK1uNRF5u1FtC-0&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Context:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This come up as part of initiatives is to reduce out-of-limit excess, which has consistently been one of the top reasons for excess transactions:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Aug 2026: 21.1% (#2)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Jul 2026: 26.2% (#1)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Jun 2026: 30.9% (#1)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;May 2026: 30.5% (#1)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Apr 2026: 31% (#1)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To accurately determine whether a member&apos;s available benefit limit is sufficient for a transaction, Good Doctor needs to have reliable and structured benefit information from the TPA, including the relationship between Plan &#8594; Benefit &#8594; Assigned Plan -&amp;gt; Member.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently, this requires us to strengthen the fundamental data structure that determines which benefits are applicable to each member. The first touchpoint in the member lifecycle where this relationship can be established is member linking.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, this initiative focuses on improving the foundation of benefit-to-plan and member mapping during the linking process. By ensuring that the correct plan and its corresponding benefits are identified from the beginning, downstream processes can use a more reliable benefit structure when validating eligibility, checking available limits, and determining potential excess.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This serves as a foundational step toward reducing out-of-limit excess and improving the accuracy of benefit validation throughout the member lifecycle journey.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Definition of Done:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;User can linking automatically via API Meditap in Good Doctor&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;System can create new assigned plan based on assigned plan template automatically during linking process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scenario&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Body Request:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;{  
 &quot;cardNo&quot;: &amp;lt;member code&amp;gt;,  
 &quot;planCode&quot;: &amp;lt;TM/OP&amp;gt;, (Hardcoded,TBC) (?)
 &quot;birthDate&quot;: &amp;lt;DOB&amp;gt;,  
}  &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;System Flow in High Level:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;User/Partner from Plugin request to System for linking&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/60535&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260922-092513.png&quot; width=&quot;360&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;System determine that the card number from AGG-0006 (Meditap, Production) &lt;em&gt;&#8594; determined by Toggle on Channel Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;System hit API Meditap: &lt;tt&gt;Member Eligibility By Card Number&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Use Case:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&apos;table-wrap&apos;&gt;
&lt;table class=&apos;confluenceTable&apos;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;response.code&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;data.status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What System will do&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expected Outcome to User &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;WIP&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;0000&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;valid&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;System check based on combination for Assigned Plan:
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Aggregator: Meditap (AGG-0006)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Payor: insurance (from response API, case insensitive)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Corporate: policyHolderName&lt;br/&gt;
 (from response API, case insensitive )&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If the combination already exist on Assigned Plan, then move to #4&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If the combination not exist on Assigned Plan, System will recheck on Template Assigned Plan
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;System will create Assigned Plan based on Template Assigned Plan&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;System named Plan with format: Plan_&amp;lt;Aggregator Name&amp;gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;lt;Payment Model&amp;gt;&amp;lt;Coshare that covered on benefit&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;lt;Benefit Named Covered on Assigned Plan&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Notes:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Default Payment Mode: PPU&lt;br/&gt;
Prescription Benefit changed name to Rx&lt;br/&gt;
Delivery Fee Benefit changed name to Delivery&lt;br/&gt;
Example
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Plan_Meditap_PPU_80%_GP SP Rx Delivery&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;System created Assigned Plan based on newly created Plan
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Contract Start Date: based on Creation Assigned Plan Date&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Contract End Date: &amp;lt;empty&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Care Model: Standard&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;System will create member, attached assigned plan with fitting combination and fill up details from API:
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Full Name: name,&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Gender: gender,&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional Policy/Card Number: policyNo,&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Policy Coverage Start Date: based on Creation Member Date&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Policy Coverage End Date: &amp;lt;empty&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Member Type: membership
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;if membership is KARYAWAN then Member Type: Principal&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;if membership is SUAMI/ISTRI KARYAWAN then
			&lt;ol&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;Member Type: Dependant&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;Relationship: Spouse&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;Principal Member Code: &amp;lt;empty&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ol&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;if membership is ANAK KARYAWAN
			&lt;ol&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;Member Type: Dependant&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;Relationship: Child&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;Principal Member Code: &amp;lt;empty&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ol&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Else Member Type: Principal&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;Display Success Message&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/60538&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260923-035926.png&quot; width=&quot;308&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
